Relevant columns and their potential usage  
- `date`: filter transactions to the target calendar years (2019‑2021).  
- `category`: category code, required for grouping.  
- `category_name`: human‑readable category label, useful for the final report.  
- `sale_dollars`: numerator to compute a per‑liter retail price.  
- `volume_sold_liters`: denominator to compute the per‑liter retail price.  
- Condition hints:  
    • `EXTRACT(YEAR FROM date) IN (2019,2020,2021)` – keep only the years of interest.  
    • `sale_dollars > 0 AND volume_sold_liters > 0` – ignore returns / bad rows.

